{"seq":1,"slug":"composite-nodes","title":"组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/composite-nodes","wordCount":634,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"组合节点-sequence-selector-与-parallel\">组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>组合节点（Composite Node）是行为树的骨架，它们不执行实际游戏逻辑，而是定义子节点的<strong>执行策略</strong>——决定何时执行哪些子节点、如何聚合返回值。三种基本组合节点覆盖了绝大多数决策模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[组合节点] --&gt; B[Sequence\\n与 AND]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Selector\\n或 OR]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Parallel\\n同时执行]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;子节点全部 SUCCESS\\n=&gt; SUCCESS\\n任意 FAILURE\\n=&gt; FAILURE&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;任意 SUCCESS\\n=&gt; SUCCESS\\n全部 FAILURE\\n=&gt; FAILURE&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;按 Policy 决定\\nRequireOne / RequireAll&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[组合节点] --&gt; B[Sequence\\n与 AND]\n    A --&gt; C[Selector\\n或 OR]\n    A --&gt; D[Parallel\\n同时执行]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"子节点全部 SUCCESS\\n=&gt; SUCCESS\\n任意 FAILURE\\n=&gt; FAILURE\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"任意 SUCCESS\\n=&gt; SUCCESS\\n全部 FAILURE\\n=&gt; FAILURE\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"按 Policy 决定\\nRequireOne / RequireAll\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>逻辑语义</th>\n<th>成功条件</th>\n<th>失败条件</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sequence</td>\n<td>AND</td>\n<td>所有子节点 SUCCESS</td>\n<td>任意子节点 FAILURE</td>\n<td><code>if A then B then C</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selector</td>\n<td>OR</td>\n<td>任意子节点 SUCCESS</td>\n<td>所有子节点 FAILURE</td>\n<td><code>try A; if fail try B; if fail try C</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parallel</td>\n<td>同时</td>\n<td>依 Policy</td>\n<td>依 Policy</td>\n<td>多线程执行（伪并行）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sequence-节点-串行与门\">Sequence 节点：串行与门</h2><p>Sequence 节点按顺序执行子节点，<strong>全部成功</strong>才算成功，<strong>任一失败</strong>立即停止并返回失败。这是 BT 中最常见的节点，用于表达「先做 A，再做 B，再做 C」的顺序行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class SequenceNode implements CompositeNode {&#10;  private currentIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    while (this.currentIndex &lt; this.children.length) {&#10;      const child = this.children[this.currentIndex];&#10;      const status = child.tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;      switch (status) {&#10;        case NodeStatus.SUCCESS:&#10;          this.currentIndex++; // 推进到下一个子节点&#10;          break;&#10;        case NodeStatus.FAILURE:&#10;          this.currentIndex = 0; // 重置，下次 tick 从头开始&#10;          return NodeStatus.FAILURE;&#10;        case NodeStatus.RUNNING:&#10;          return NodeStatus.RUNNING; // 保留 currentIndex，下帧继续&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    this.currentIndex = 0; // 全部完成，重置&#10;    return NodeStatus.SUCCESS;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onAbort(): void {&#10;    this.children[this.currentIndex]?.onAbort?.();&#10;    this.currentIndex = 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SequenceNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompositeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> currentIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推进到下一个子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重置，下次 tick 从头开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保留 currentIndex，下帧继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 全部完成，重置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onAbort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex]?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onAbort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?.();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.currentIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>典型使用模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Sequence [战斗行为]&#10;  ├── Condition: IsEnemyVisible&#10;  ├── Condition: HasAmmo&#10;  ├── Action: MoveToAttackPosition&#10;  └── Action: Attack\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Sequence [战斗行为]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Condition: IsEnemyVisible</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Condition: HasAmmo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Action: MoveToAttackPosition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Action: Attack</span></span></code></pre></div><p>含义：「如果看到敌人 AND 有弹药，则移动到攻击位，然后攻击」——任一条件不满足，或移动失败，整个战斗行为 FAILURE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"selector-节点-优先级选择器\">Selector 节点：优先级选择器</h2><p>Selector（也称 Fallback 节点）按顺序尝试子节点，<strong>任一成功</strong>立即返回成功，<strong>全部失败</strong>才返回失败。用于表达「优先尝试 A，不行试 B，最后试 C」的降级逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class SelectorNode implements CompositeNode {&#10;  private currentIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    while (this.currentIndex &lt; this.children.length) {&#10;      const child = this.children[this.currentIndex];&#10;      const status = child.tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;      switch (status) {&#10;        case NodeStatus.SUCCESS:&#10;          this.currentIndex = 0; // 重置&#10;          return NodeStatus.SUCCESS;&#10;        case NodeStatus.FAILURE:&#10;          this.currentIndex++; // 尝试下一个子节点&#10;          break;&#10;        case NodeStatus.RUNNING:&#10;          return NodeStatus.RUNNING;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    this.currentIndex = 0;&#10;    return NodeStatus.FAILURE; // 全部失败&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SelectorNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompositeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> currentIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style