/span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查成功条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.successPolicy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ONE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> successCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.successPolicy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ALL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> successCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查失败条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failurePolicy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ONE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failureCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failurePolicy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ALL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failureCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Parallel 的典型用途</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Parallel [边移动边扫描环境]  Policy: REQUIRE_ALL&#10;  ├── Action: MoveToTarget        (RUNNING 直到到达)&#10;  └── Action: ScanForThreats      (RUNNING 持续扫描)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Parallel [边移动边扫描环境]  Policy: REQUIRE_ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Action: MoveToTarget        (RUNNING 直到到达)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Action: ScanForThreats      (RUNNING 持续扫描)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：Parallel 是单线程的伪并行，不创建真实线程。所有子节点在一个帧内依次 tick，开销是所有子节点开销之和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Sequence 是「AND 门」：所有子节点必须成功，常用于「前提检查 + 行动序列」</li>\n<li>Selector 是「OR 门」：任一子节点成功即可，常用于「优先级降级选择」</li>\n<li>Sequence + Selector 嵌套是 BT 最核心的组合模式，形成「行为优先级树」</li>\n<li>Parallel 在单帧内同时 tick 所有子节点，Policy 控制聚合语义（REQUIRE_ONE/REQUIRE_ALL）</li>\n<li>每种组合节点都需要维护 <code>currentIndex</code> 等状态，并实现 <code>onAbort()</code> 做清理</li>\n<li>Parallel 开销 = 所有子节点开销之和，避免在 Parallel 下放置重型子树</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel","id":"组合节点-sequence-selector-与-parallel"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Sequence 节点：串行与门","id":"sequence-节点-串行与门"},{"level":2,"text":"Selector 节点：优先级选择器","id":"selector-节点-优先级选择器"},{"level":2,"text":"Sequence 与 Selector 的嵌套组合","id":"sequence-与-selector-的嵌套组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Parallel 节点：伪并行执行","id":"parallel-节点-伪并行执行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Blackboard 通信架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations/blackboard-architecture"},"next":{"title":"装饰节点：修改行为语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/decorator-nodes"}}